{"id":68549,"date":"2024-10-03T08:58:41","date_gmt":"2024-10-03T07:58:41","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=68549"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:55:27","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:55:27","slug":"meia-maratona-de-faro","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-de-faro\/","title":{"rendered":"X Meia Maratona de Faro 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">X Meia Maratona de Faro 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>X Meia Maratona de Faro 2027<\/strong> (10\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, dia <strong>10 de abril de 2027<\/strong>, com tiro de partida marcado para as <strong>17:00<\/strong> na emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Praia de Faro<\/strong> e linha de meta instalada no cora\u00e7\u00e3o da capital algarvia, no <strong>Jardim Manuel B\u00edvar<\/strong>, em <strong>Faro<\/strong>. Limitada a 3.000 participantes (2.000 nas corridas competitivas e 1.000 na caminhada), esta cl\u00e1ssica prova de fim de tarde oferece um cen\u00e1rio \u00fanico ao p\u00f4r do sol.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O evento compreende tr\u00eas dist\u00e2ncias em linha ligando o cord\u00e3o dunar do <strong>Parque Natural da Ria Formosa<\/strong> \u00e0 frente ribeirinha e marina da cidade de <strong>Faro<\/strong>: a <strong>Meia Maratona de 21,097 km<\/strong> (homologada pela Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Atletismo), a competitiva <strong>Mini Maratona de 10,5 km<\/strong> e uma <strong>Caminhada de 11 km<\/strong>. Podes preparar a tua estrat\u00e9gia de corrida na <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/tabela-paces-meia-maratona\/\">Tabela de Paces de Meia Maratona<\/a>, calcular parciais na <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a> e descobrir mais eventos de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/meia-maratona\/\">Meia Maratona<\/a> ou no calend\u00e1rio de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-faro\/\">corridas em Faro<\/a>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pelo <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Faro<\/strong> com o apoio t\u00e9cnico da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Algarve, a prova disponibiliza servi\u00e7o de bengaleiro m\u00f3vel entre a Praia de Faro e a meta, transporte em autocarro a partir do Largo de S\u00e3o Francisco, abastecimentos de \u00e1gua e isot\u00f3nico e pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios para os cinco primeiros da geral masculina e feminina nos 21 km (1.000 \u20ac para os vencedores), escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios e sorteio final entre os finalistas.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data & Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 de Abril de 2027 \u00e0s 17:00<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Partida na Praia de Faro \/ Meta no Jardim Manuel B\u00edvar<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5p